<title>USA: Imperial Credit ups dividend to $0.55/shr.</title>
<headline>Imperial Credit ups dividend to $0.55/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA HEIGHTS, Calif 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Credit Mortgage Holdings Inc said its board approved a six percent increase in the fourth quarter dividend to $0.55 per share from $0.52 a share in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on January 15, 1997 to stockholders of record on December 31, 1996.</p>
